{"seq":1,"slug":"photometry-spectroscopy","title":"测光与光谱学：天体物理量的定量提取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/observational-techniques/photometry-spectroscopy","wordCount":2441,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"测光与光谱学-天体物理量的定量提取\">测光与光谱学：天体物理量的定量提取</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>测光（Photometry）和光谱学（Spectroscopy）是从天体辐射中提取定量物理信息的两大核心技术。测光测量天体在特定波段内的积分流量，获取亮度、颜色和时间变化信息；光谱学将辐射按波长色散，揭示化学组成、温度、密度、运动速度和磁场等精细物理参数。两者互为补充——测光提供广度（大样本、多历元），光谱提供深度（逐源物理诊断）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>测光与光谱是提取天体物理量的两大支柱，其分工由<strong>信息密度</strong>决定：测光把流量在宽波段内积分，只保留亮度与颜色，代价是丢失谱线细节，换来大样本与多历元；光谱把辐射按波长色散，保留谱线形状与位置，换来温度、丰度、速度等精细参数，代价是每个目标需更多光子。定量化的关键是把仪器计数转换为可比较的物理量——这要求明确 <strong>零点体系</strong>（Vega vs AB）和 <strong>分辨率标度</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\lambda/\\Delta\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>测光</th>\n<th>光谱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据内容</td>\n<td>波段积分流量（星等/颜色）</td>\n<td>逐波长流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提取参数</td>\n<td>亮度、颜色、时变</td>\n<td>温度、丰度、速度、磁场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样广度</td>\n<td>数十亿源、多历元</td>\n<td>百万级源（受光子预算限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零点/标度</td>\n<td>Vega 或 AB 系统</td>\n<td>分辨率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=\\lambda/\\Delta\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互补关系</td>\n<td>为光谱巡天选目标</td>\n<td>标定测光红移的训练集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"测光学\">测光学</h2><h3 id=\"测光系统\">测光系统</h3><p>天文测光通过定义好的滤光片系统量化天体亮度。标准测光系统的核心要素是一组透过率曲线已知的滤光片和一套零点定标关系。</p>\n<p><strong>Johnson-Cousins UBVRI 系统</strong>：经典宽带系统，定义了天文星等的基本框架。</p>\n<p><strong>SDSS ugriz 系统</strong>：以 AB 星等为零点（基于单位频率流量密度），消除了维加星等系统的光谱型依赖，已成为光学巡天的事实标准。</p>\n<p><strong>窄带系统</strong>：通过 50–200 Å 带宽滤光片隔离特定发射线或吸收特征（如 Hα、[OIII]、Lyα），实现免光谱的发射线天体筛选。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>波段数</th>\n<th>典型带宽</th>\n<th>零点体系</th>\n<th>代表巡天</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Johnson-Cousins</td>\n<td>5 (UBVRI)</td>\n<td>700–2200 Å</td>\n<td>Vega</td>\n<td>历史标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SDSS</td>\n<td>5 (ugriz)</td>\n<td>1000–1500 Å</td>\n<td>AB</td>\n<td>SDSS, DES</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LSST</td>\n<td>6 (ugrizy)</td>\n<td>1000–1500 Å</td>\n<td>AB</td>\n<td>Rubin LSST</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Strömgren</td>\n<td>4 (uvby) + Hβ</td>\n<td>200–300 Å</td>\n<td>Vega</td>\n<td>恒星参数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"星等与流量\">星等与流量</h3><p>星等系统将流量密度转换为对数标度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.5</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = -2.5 \\log_{10}\\left(\\frac{F}{F_0}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>AB 系统零点定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3631</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0 = 3631</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3631</span></span></span></span></span> Jy（所有波段统一）。两星等差对应流量比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{F_1}{F_2} = 10^{-0.4(m_1 - m_2)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.4</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"测光精度的限制因素\">测光精度的限制因素</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[测光精度] --&gt; B[光子噪声]&#10;    A --&gt; C[天空背景]&#10;    A --&gt; D[大气消光]&#10;    A --&gt; E[仪器效应]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[源计数统计涨落]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[天光减除残差]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[消光系数标定]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[时变大气]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[平场精度]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[非线性/饱和]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[分馏效应]\">flowchart TB\n    A[测光精度] --&gt; B[光子噪声]\n    A --&gt; C[天空背景]\n    A --&gt; D[大气消光]\n    A --&gt; E[仪器效应]\n    B --&gt; B1[源计数统计涨落]\n    C --&gt; C1[天光减除残差]\n    D --&gt; D1[消光系数标定]\n    D --&gt; D2[时变大气]\n    E --&gt; E1[平场精度]\n    E --&gt; E2[非线性/饱和]\n    E --&gt; E3[分馏效应]</pre><p>现代巡天测光精度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>亮端（14–18 mag）：~1–5 mmag（系统误差主导）</li>\n<li>中等亮度（18–22 mag）：~10–50 mmag（光子噪声与背景竞争）</li>\n<li>暗端（&gt;24 mag）：~100–300 mmag（背景限制）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"差分图像测光\">差分图像测光</h3><p>时域天文学的核心技术是差分图像分析（DIA）：将新观测图像与深度参考模板图像相减，只保留发生亮度变化的源。</p>\n<p>步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>将模板图像 PSF 卷积匹配到新图像的 PSF</li>\n<li>对齐、缩放后相减</li>\n<li>在差分图像上进行源检测和测光</li>\n<li>正余像分别对应变亮和变暗事件</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Vera C. Rubin 天文台的警报管线正是基于此原理——每晚将新图像与模板相减，在 60 秒内产生变源警报。</p>\n<h3 id=\"测光红移\">测光红移</h3><p>利用多波段测光数据，通过模板拟合或机器学习估计星系的红移（无需光谱）。原理是 Lyman 断裂和 Balmer 断裂等光谱特征在通过不同滤光片时产生可辨识的颜色变化。测光红移的精度通常为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><mn>0.02</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_z / (1+z) \\sim 0.02–0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02–0.05</span></span></span></span></span>，虽不及光谱红移（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_z &lt; 0.001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span></span></span></span></span>），但可在巡天时间内获取数十亿星系的红移估计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"光谱学\">光谱学</h2><h3 id=\"色散原理\">色散原理</h3><p>光谱仪将入射光按波长分离，核心色散元件包括：</p>\n<p><strong>棱镜</strong>：利用材料折射率的色散特性。色散率随波长非线性变化，紫端色散大、红端小。优点是效率高且无多级衍射重叠。</p>\n<p><strong>反射光栅</strong>：利用衍射原理，光栅方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\lambda = d(\\sin\\alpha + \\sin\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mλ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为刻线间距，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 为入射和衍射角，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 为衍射级次。分辨率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = mN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为照明刻线数）。</p>\n<p><strong>体相位全息光栅（VPH）</strong>：在明胶层中制作折射率调制结构，兼具高效率和可调特性。</p>\n<p><strong>回声梯光栅（Echelle）</strong>：在极高级次（m~50–100）工作的粗刻线光栅，配合交叉色散器将各级次分离到二维探测器上，实现高分辨率的同时覆盖宽波长范围。</p>\n<h3 id=\"光谱分辨率\">光谱分辨率</h3><p>分辨率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\lambda / \\Delta\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 表征光谱仪分辨两个相邻波长特征的能力。对应到速度空间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta v = \\frac{c}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>R 值</th>\n<th>对应速度分辨率</th>\n<th>典型仪器</th>\n<th>科学应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>600 km/s</td>\n<td>棱镜光谱仪</td>\n<td>红移测量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2000</td>\n<td>150 km/s</td>\n<td>SDSS/DESI 光纤光谱</td>\n<td>星系巡天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20000</td>\n<td>15 km/s</td>\n<td>UVES/HIRES</td>\n<td>恒星丰度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100000</td>\n<td>3 km/s</td>\n<td>ESPRESSO/HARPS</td>\n<td>系外行星 RV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>500000</td>\n<td>0.6 km/s</td>\n<td>实验室光谱</td>\n<td>同位素测量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"多目标光谱技术\">多目标光谱技术</h3><p>现代光谱巡天要求同时观测大量目标：</p>\n<p><strong>多光纤光谱</strong>：将光纤端头精确放置在焦面上目标位置，另一端排列为伪缝送入光谱仪。DESI（暗能量光谱仪器）拥有 5000 根机器人光纤，每次曝光观测 5000 个天体。</p>\n<p><strong>多缝光谱</strong>：在焦面放置激光切割的多缝板，每个缝位对准一个目标。</p>\n<p><strong>无缝棱镜光谱</strong>：整个视场的光通过棱镜色散，每个源产生一条低分辨率光谱条带。适合密集场的红移测量（如 HST/GRISM、JWST/NIRISS）。</p>\n<p><strong>积分场光谱（IFU）</strong>：通过图像切片器、透镜阵列或光纤束将二维视场重排为一维伪缝，每个空间元获取完整光谱。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 多光纤&#10;        A1[焦面光纤] --&gt; A2[光谱仪 1]&#10;        A1 --&gt; A3[光谱仪 2]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph IFU&#10;        B1[图像切片器] --&gt; B2[重排为伪缝]&#10;        B2 --&gt; B3[光栅色散]&#10;        B3 --&gt; B4[3D 数据立方体]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 多光纤\n        A1[焦面光纤] --&gt; A2[光谱仪 1]\n        A1 --&gt; A3[光谱仪 2]\n    end\n    subgraph IFU\n        B1[图像切片器] --&gt; B2[重排为伪缝]\n        B2 --&gt; B3[光栅色散]\n        B3 --&gt; B4[3D 数据立方体]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"光谱诊断\">光谱诊断</h3><p>光谱蕴含的物理信息极为丰富：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测量</th>\n<th>物理信息</th>\n<th>测量方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>谱线波长位移</td>\n<td>径向速度/红移</td>\n<td>多普勒公式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谱线宽度</td>\n<td>温度、湍流、自转</td>\n<td>线轮廓拟合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谱线等值宽度</td>\n<td>元素丰度</td>\n<td>增长曲线分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续谱形状</td>\n<td>有效温度</td>\n<td>黑体/模型拟合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Balmer 跳变</td>\n<td>表面重力（log g）</td>\n<td>光谱分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分子带强度</td>\n<td>低温恒星分类</td>\n<td>TiO, VO 带</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发射线比</td>\n<td>电子温度/密度</td>\n<td>禁线诊断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"光谱巡天的数据规模\">光谱巡天的数据规模</h2><h3 id=\"当代光谱巡天\">当代光谱巡天</h3><p>大规模光谱巡天正将光谱学从&quot;精英工具&quot;变为&quot;统计基础设施&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>巡天</th>\n<th>光纤数/目标数</th>\n<th>R 值</th>\n<th>目标总数</th>\n<th>科学目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SDSS-V</td>\n<td>500 (FPS)</td>\n<td>2000/22000</td>\n<td>~600 万</td>\n<td>银河系+黑洞生长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DESI</td>\n<td>5000</td>\n<td>2000–5000</td>\n<td>~4000 万</td>\n<td>暗能量 BAO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4MOST</td>\n<td>2436</td>\n<td>5000/20000</td>\n<td>~3500 万</td>\n<td>银河系+宇宙学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WEAVE</td>\n<td>960</td>\n<td>5000/20000</td>\n<td>~2500 万</td>\n<td>银河考古+星系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LAMOST</td>\n<td>4000</td>\n<td>1800/7500</td>\n<td>&gt;2000 万</td>\n<td>银河系巡天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"数据处理管线\">数据处理管线</h3><p>从原始二维光谱图像到科学级一维光谱的处理流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>减除仪器特征</strong>：暗场减除、平场校正</li>\n<li><strong>波长标定</strong>：弧光灯谱线定标</li>\n<li><strong>天光减除</strong>：使用专用天光光纤或 B-spline 拟合减除夜天光线</li>\n<li><strong>最优提取</strong>：沿空间方向加权提取一维光谱（Horne 1986 算法）</li>\n<li><strong>流量标定</strong>：光谱标准星修正仪器响应</li>\n<li><strong>红移/参数测量</strong>：交叉相关或模板拟合</li>\n<li><strong>质量标记</strong>：自动和人工质量控制</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前沿方向\">前沿方向</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>高复用度光谱仪</strong>：单次曝光 &gt;10,000 目标（如 DESI 的成功推动更高复用度设计）</li>\n<li><strong>光子能量分辨探测器</strong>：超导隧道结（STJ）和微波动能电感探测器（MKID）可同时记录每个光子的到达时间和能量，无需色散光学</li>\n<li><strong>高对比度光谱</strong>：结合日冕仪的系外行星直接光谱——测量反射光或热辐射中的分子特征</li>\n<li><strong>实时光谱分类</strong>：机器学习驱动的暂现源快速光谱确认（如 SEDM、SOAR 4m 的快速反应光谱）</li>\n<li><strong>积分场巡天</strong>：大视场 IFU 如 MUSE 的升级版本，或空间 IFU 如 Roman/grism，实现 3D 宇宙学巡天</li>\n</ul>\n<p>测光与光谱学正在从独立工具走向深度融合——测光红移为光谱巡天选目标，光谱训练集标定测光红移，两者在数据驱动的天文学中形成闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>测光与光谱分工互补：测光提供广度（大样本、多历元），光谱提供深度（逐源物理诊断）。</li>\n<li>测光的核心是把仪器计数转换为标准星等，依赖明确的滤光片系统与零点体系（Vega 或 AB）。</li>\n<li>测光精度受光子噪声、天空背景、大气消光和仪器效应共同限制；差分图像测光（DIA）是时域天文学的核心技术。</li>\n<li>光谱的颜色色散由棱镜、光栅、VPH、回声梯光栅承担，分辨率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=\\lambda/\\Delta\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 直接决定可提取的物理信息量。</li>\n<li>多目标光谱（多光纤、多缝、无缝棱镜、IFU）与大口径巡天结合，使光谱学从精英工具变为统计基础设施。</li>\n<li>数据处理管线（减除仪器特征→波长标定→天光减除→最优提取→流量标定→参数测量）是光谱巡天的工业化基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测光与光谱学：天体物理量的定量提取","id":"测光与光谱学-天体物理量的定量提取"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"测光学","id":"测光学"},{"level":3,"text":"测光系统","id":"测光系统"},{"level":3,"text":"星等与流量","id":"星等与流量"},{"level":3,"text":"测光精度的限制因素","id":"测光精度的限制因素"},{"level":3,"text":"差分图像测光","id":"差分图像测光"},{"level":3,"text":"测光红移","id":"测光红移"},{"level":2,"text":"光谱学","id":"光谱学"},{"level":3,"text":"色散原理","id":"色散原理"},{"level":3,"text":"光谱分辨率","id":"光谱分辨率"},{"level":3,"text":"多目标光谱技术","id":"多目标光谱技术"},{"level":3,"text":"光谱诊断","id":"光谱诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"光谱巡天的数据规模","id":"光谱巡天的数据规模"},{"level":3,"text":"当代光谱巡天","id":"当代光谱巡天"},{"level":3,"text":"数据处理管线","id":"数据处理管线"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿方向","id":"前沿方向"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"空间望远镜：突破大气层的限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/telescope-technology/space-telescopes"},"next":{"title":"天体测量与视差：精确定位宇宙的坐标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/observational-techniques/astrometry-parallax"}}